OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence condemned
OL,4,Aas six arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of officers were injured and
OL,7,Ffive police cars and three fire engines
OL,8,Fwere damaged during the disorder, which
OL,9,Fwas linked to misinformation that the
OL,10,Fbuilding would be a house of multiple
OL,11,Foccupation (HMO) for asylum seekers,
OL,12,Fthe force said.
OL,14,FCh Supt Daniel Whyte said anyone
OL,15,Finvolved in the disorder should expect
OL,16,Fa "knock on the door".
